 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0032/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0032</a>|2026/09/03 04:36| 01 | 088| 054| 1404| 0305| 0735| 1859|    \n  <a href=\"CME0031/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0031</a>|2026/09/02 20:48| 01 | 244| 006| 0687| 0237| 0514| 1116|    \n  <a href=\"CME0030/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0030</a>|2026/09/02 20:36| 02 | 304| 074| 0455| 0396| 0170| 1412|    \n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/09/02 20:36| 01 | 192| 014| 0535| 0237| 0331| 1076|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/09/02 19:36| 03 | 071| 140| 0694| 0202| 0231| 1040|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/09/02 16:00| 03 | 083| 040| 022"
